      "text": "You have a Laptop\nYou have a Computer \nAnd yet you have not set up your node in @theblessnetwork at https://t.co/FZGuLQ4KCB\nYou’re missing a lot of\n\nLet me walk you through the bullishness of Bless and how much Traffic it generates just this Quarter alone \n https://t.co/JTb5LnX1pn is the official website of @theblessnetwork handling the mining \nthis is a breakdown of users activity on it \n\nAs at May 2025  over \n2.06 million users visits in May 2025 (12% drop from April)\nAverage session: 9 min 21 sec, with 2.73 pages per visit\nPopular visitor countries:\nNigeria: 31.4% (646 K visits)\nIndia: 19.9% (410 K visits)\nOthers include Bangladesh, Philippines, Vietnam \n\nIn January 2025 the website recorded \nApproximately 4.73 million visits in January 2025\nAverage session: 7 min 48 sec, with 2.93 pages per visit\nVisitors primarily from Nigeria, Kenya, Bangladesh, India, Pakistan \n\nThese report was extracted using personally analysis and tools\nThe official report from the team is not far different from my analysis \n\nThe team has reported view their medium articles of having over \nOver 2 million registered nodes, including 700,000+ daily active users \n\nhttps://t.co/dQrQz5LntM\n\nFrom my analysis Nigeria and Indians users contribute more to the 2 Million users",
