      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\nPROJECTS COMMISSIONING IN THE FCT\nDAY 13 - MONDAY 30TH JUNE, 2025\n\nConstruction of the newly constructed road in Giri.\n\nAll roads lead to Giri, the EFCC Academy site and Venue for dignitaries and invited guests.\nConnecting points along the Airport Road - Bill Clinton Junction - Giri and beyond the road heading towards the newly created U-turn will be managed such that traffic will be stopped intermittently to allow for movement of dignitaries.\n\nTraffic control personnel and security agents will be deployed accordingly.\n\nThere will be no major diversion at about 1100am when movement will be activated.\n\n- Head Traffic, DRTS",
